&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and a service-oriented approach to employee support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage competing priorities in a dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of HR compliance and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
