&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:181;530-710&quot;&gt;Typeform is a leading provider of interactive forms, surveys, and data collection experiences. We help businesses create more engaging ways to collect, manage, and understand data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-13:258;712-969&quot;&gt;This team sits at the intersection of our go-to-market and product organizations, working directly with enterprise customers to validate use cases, accelerate strategic opportunities, and shape how our products evolve through real-world customer engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-3 -mb-1 text-[1.125rem] font-bold&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;15:1-15:22;971-992&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-17:230;994-1223&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Forward Deployed Engineer to bridge the gap between our enterprise customers and our product, building prototypes for strategic opportunities that accelerate sales cycles and inform product development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;19:1-19:300;1225-1524&quot;&gt;This role is ideal for someone who thrives on direct customer engagement and enjoys turning ambiguous enterprise requirements into working software—fast. You&#39;ll build prototypes, support high-value enterprise deals, and translate customer needs into insights that directly shape our product roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; data-sourcepos=&quot;21:1-21:173;1526-1698&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll partner closely with Sales, Product, and Engineering teams to validate customer use cases, deliver solutions in the field, and feed learnings back into how we build.&lt;/p&gt;
