&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Who we are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typeform is a refreshingly different form builder. We help over 150,000 businesses collect the data they need with forms, surveys, and quizzes that people enjoy. Designed to look striking and feel effortless to fill out, Typeform drives 500 million responses every year—and integrates with essential tools like Slack, Zapier, and Hubspot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior FP&amp;amp;A Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Finance team and help drive clarity through data. This is a &lt;strong&gt;hands-on, individual contributor role&lt;/strong&gt; with a strong focus on analysis and execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional finance business partner or governance role. Instead, you’ll spend most of your time working directly with data, building models, analyzing performance, and translating complex signals into clear, actionable insights for Product, Growth, and Go-to-Market teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll thrive in this role if you enjoy digging deep into numbers, understand SaaS and product-led growth dynamics, and are comfortable owning analyses from start to finish.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, maintain, and improve financial and operational models to support forecasting, planning, and performance tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze key &lt;strong&gt;SaaS and PLG metrics&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g. ARR, expansion, churn, CAC, LTV, conversion funnels) and connect them to business drivers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Growth, and Go-to-Market teams to understand performance and surface insights — without acting as a traditional finance gatekeeper&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn complex data into &lt;strong&gt;clear narratives and recommendations&lt;/strong&gt; that inform decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own recurring analyses, dashboards, and reporting with a strong focus on accuracy, usability, and speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support budgeting and forecasting cycles with detailed, bottoms-up analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve how we use data, tools, and processes to understand the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in FP&amp;amp;A or a similar hands-on analytical role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience working with &lt;strong&gt;SaaS businesses&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally in a product-led growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of comfort working directly with raw data, models, and analytical tools (e.g. spreadsheets, BI tools, SQL — depending on your stack)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to translate analysis into &lt;strong&gt;practical, actionable insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with Marketing, Growth, or Commercial teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An execution-first mindset: you enjoy owning problems end-to-end and getting things done&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating as an &lt;strong&gt;experienced individual contributor&lt;/strong&gt;, without people management responsibilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, adaptable, and able to navigate ambiguity in a fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;*Typeform drives hundreds of millions of interactions each year, enabling conversational, human-centered experiences across the globe. We &lt;strong&gt;move as one team&lt;/strong&gt;, empowering our collective efforts by valuing each individual’s unique perspective. This fosters &lt;strong&gt;strong bonds&lt;/strong&gt; grounded in respect, transparency, and trust. We &lt;strong&gt;champion our diverse customer base&lt;/strong&gt; by anticipating their needs and addressing their challenges with priority. Committed to excellence, we&lt;strong&gt; hold high expectations &lt;/strong&gt;for ourselves and each other, continuously striving to deliver exceptional results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and stand firmly against discrimination and harassment of any kind—whether based on race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or expression, or veteran status. Everyone is welcome here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Who we are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typeform is a refreshingly different form builder. We help over 150,000 businesses collect the data they need with forms, surveys, and quizzes that people enjoy. Designed to look striking and feel effortless to fill out, Typeform drives 500 million responses every year—and integrates with essential tools like Slack, Zapier, and Hubspot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Paid Marketing Strategist to help us rethink how Typeform approaches paid acquisition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’ll own and grow key channels including TikTok, YouTube, Google Performance Max and Uber Ads, while helping us test new opportunities across areas such as audio and CTV.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This is a hands on role with real ownership. You’ll manage significant media budgets, build channel strategy, develop campaigns, work closely with our creative teams, and help us understand the true business impact of our investment through MMM, incrementality testing and other measurement approaches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’ll join the Acquisition team within Marketing and partner closely with Creative, Product Marketing, Data, RevOps and Finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the strategy and day to day performance of key paid social and display channels, including TikTok, YouTube, Google Performance Max and Uber Ads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a multichannel strategy that helps Typeform reduce its reliance on paid search and find new sources of efficient growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage six figure monthly media budgets, making decisions based on customer acquisition, revenue, CAC and LTV to CAC performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, launch and optimise campaigns that drive Typeform signups and new paid customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn creative ideas into campaigns by briefing and partnering closely with copywriters and designers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run A/B tests across creative, copy, landing pages, placements, audiences and bidding strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and test new channels such as audio and CTV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and develop our paid marketing measurement approach, including Marketing Mix Modelling, incrementality studies and alternative measurement frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design experiments that help us understand the incremental impact of our campaigns rather than relying solely on traditional attribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with our Tracking and Data teams to strengthen our measurement capabilities as digital advertising continues to change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share insights, results and recommendations across Marketing and the wider business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Typeform’s broader full funnel acquisition strategy across demand creation and demand capture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Around six or more years of hands on and strategic experience in performance marketing and media buying.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience managing paid social and video channels, ideally including TikTok, YouTube and Meta.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning campaigns from initial idea and creative brief through implementation, optimisation and measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of managing six figure budgets and delivering efficient performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with MMM, incrementality testing or other measurement methods beyond traditional attribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and confidence working with campaign performance, conversion funnels, CAC and LTV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of digital measurement, from tagging and attribution through to incrementality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing creative and UGC assets for paid social channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to balance creative thinking with strong commercial judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and a willingness to figure things out. When you do not know the answer, you know how to find it, whether that means speaking to the right person, digging into documentation or using AI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working across teams and influencing partners in Creative, Product Marketing, Data and Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating with uncertainty. You are happy testing ideas, learning from the results and changing direction when the data tells you to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in SaaS or B2B lead generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience across sales technology or marketing technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing external agencies or digital production partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ad servers and campaign trafficking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;*Typeform drives hundreds of millions of interactions each year, enabling conversational, human-centered experiences across the globe. We &lt;strong&gt;move as one team&lt;/strong&gt;, empowering our collective efforts by valuing each individual’s unique perspective. This fosters &lt;strong&gt;strong bonds&lt;/strong&gt; grounded in respect, transparency, and trust. We &lt;strong&gt;champion our diverse customer base&lt;/strong&gt; by anticipating their needs and addressing their challenges with priority. Committed to excellence, we&lt;strong&gt; hold high expectations &lt;/strong&gt;for ourselves and each other, continuously striving to deliver exceptional results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and stand firmly against discrimination and harassment of any kind—whether based on race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or expression, or veteran status. Everyone is welcome here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Who we are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typeform is a refreshingly different form builder. We help over 150,000 businesses collect the data they need with forms, surveys, and quizzes that people enjoy. Designed to look striking and feel effortless to fill out, Typeform drives 500 million responses every year—and integrates with essential tools like Slack, Zapier, and Hubspot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Typeform&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typeform helps people create better conversations at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Millions of people use Typeform to collect information, understand their customers, generate leads, run research, gather feedback, and power workflows across their businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are continuing to evolve Typeform from a form builder into a broader platform for collecting, understanding, and acting on information. AI is becoming a major part of that direction, both through experiences we build for customers and through making Typeform easier for AI agents and other products to interact with.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Product Manager to help shape what comes next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Manager at Typeform, you will own a meaningful product area and work closely with Engineering, Design, Data, Research, Marketing, and other teams to turn customer problems and business opportunities into products people genuinely want to use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for understanding the problem space, setting product direction, deciding where the team should focus, and helping the team move from insight to execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a role where Product simply writes requirements and hands them to Engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We expect our Product Managers to be close to customers, opinionated about the problems worth solving, comfortable making decisions with incomplete information, and able to bring teams together around a clear direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will balance customer value, product quality, technical considerations, and commercial impact while helping the team move quickly and learn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you will do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the strategy and roadmap for a key area of the Typeform product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a strong understanding of our customers, their workflows, and the problems they are trying to solve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities through customer conversations, behavioural data, research, market insight, and product intuition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn broad problems into clear product bets, hypotheses, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Design and Engineering from discovery through delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Data and Research to understand customer behaviour and evaluate whether what we build is working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make thoughtful prioritisation decisions across customer needs, business goals, technical investment, and product quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success measures and use them to guide product decisions before and after launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run experiments where appropriate and use the results to shape future product direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Marketing, Sales, Customer Success, and other teams to ensure we understand the wider customer and commercial context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate product direction clearly and build alignment across teams and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help teams move from ideas to shipped experiences without losing sight of the original customer problem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Look beyond individual features and think about how your product area contributes to the wider Typeform platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore how AI can improve the customer experience, change existing workflows, and create new ways for customers to get value from Typeform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have significant experience building and scaling digital products, ideally within SaaS, product led growth, collaboration software, productivity tools, or another strong product environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable taking on messy, ambiguous product problems and bringing structure and direction to them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong focus on customer problems and outcomes, rather than jumping straight to features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product judgement, with the ability to use customer insight, data, and context to make good decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close collaboration with Engineering and Design, with product development treated as a shared discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to set a clear product direction while staying practical about what the team should focus on next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident making trade offs, making decisions, and explaining the thinking behind them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good judgement around when to experiment, when to research, and when there is enough evidence to move forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication, with the ability to adapt complex ideas for different audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial awareness and an understanding of how product decisions can influence activation, engagement, retention, expansion, and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about AI and how it is changing the way products are built and how customers interact with software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A real care for product quality and the details that shape a strong customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You might be particularly strong in one or more of these areas&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We do not expect every Senior Product Manager to have the same background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Depending on the team, relevant experience could include:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product led growth, onboarding, activation, or retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creation tools, editors, builders, or content creation experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform products, APIs, integrations, or developer ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytics, insights, research, or data products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pricing, packaging, payments, or monetisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI powered products, agents, automation, or intelligent workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B2B SaaS products used across multiple teams and use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;*Typeform drives hundreds of millions of interactions each year, enabling conversational, human-centered experiences across the globe. We &lt;strong&gt;move as one team&lt;/strong&gt;, empowering our collective efforts by valuing each individual’s unique perspective. This fosters &lt;strong&gt;strong bonds&lt;/strong&gt; grounded in respect, transparency, and trust. We &lt;strong&gt;champion our diverse customer base&lt;/strong&gt; by anticipating their needs and addressing their challenges with priority. Committed to excellence, we&lt;strong&gt; hold high expectations &lt;/strong&gt;for ourselves and each other, continuously striving to deliver exceptional results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and stand firmly against discrimination and harassment of any kind—whether based on race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or expression, or veteran status. Everyone is welcome here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Who we are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typeform is a refreshingly different form builder. We help over 150,000 businesses collect the data they need with forms, surveys, and quizzes that people enjoy. Designed to look striking and feel effortless to fill out, Typeform drives 500 million responses every year—and integrates with essential tools like Slack, Zapier, and Hubspot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;492&quot; data-end=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;492&quot; data-end=&quot;510&quot;&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;492&quot; data-end=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Product Manager to lead the transformation of Typeform’s reporting and analytics experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;492&quot; data-end=&quot;1020&quot;&gt;This role sits at the center of Typeform’s strategy to turn data into a true market differentiator, driving long-term revenue growth and customer satisfaction. You’ll own the strategy and execution of AI-first analytics capabilities that deliver clear, actionable insights—helping Typeform move beyond feature-parity competitors with a smarter, faster reporting experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1022&quot; data-end=&quot;1044&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1022&quot; data-end=&quot;1042&quot;&gt;Things you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1047&quot; data-end=&quot;1198&quot;&gt;Lead the delivery of a best-in-class reporting suite, including a redesigned summary page, filtering, advanced visualisations, and AI-driven insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1201&quot; data-end=&quot;1307&quot;&gt;Define and ship the MVP for our next-gen Narrative Intelligence and “AI Copilot for Insights” experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1310&quot; data-end=&quot;1415&quot;&gt;Partner with Data Science to land foundational Copilot capabilities that scale to millions of responses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1418&quot; data-end=&quot;1502&quot;&gt;Set and drive a focused roadmap that combines quick wins with long-term innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1505&quot; data-end=&quot;1605&quot;&gt;Consolidate onboarding learnings, customer insights, and market context to guide product decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1608&quot; data-end=&quot;1709&quot;&gt;Improve key metrics like usage rates, satisfaction scores, and activation across reporting features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1712&quot; data-end=&quot;1811&quot;&gt;Build strong internal alignment and communicate product value clearly to Sales, CS, and GTM teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1814&quot; data-end=&quot;1918&quot;&gt;Ensure commercial success by helping Sales and CS articulate differentiated analytics value to customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1920&quot; data-end=&quot;1958&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1920&quot; data-end=&quot;1956&quot;&gt;What you will bring to the table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1961&quot; data-end=&quot;2056&quot;&gt;Strong strategic thinking with the ability to balance long-term vision with near-term results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2059&quot; data-end=&quot;2151&quot;&gt;High ownership mindset with a proactive approach to removing blockers and driving progress&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2154&quot; data-end=&quot;2257&quot;&gt;Proven ability to collaborate cross-functionally with Sales, CS, Data Science, Legal, and Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2260&quot; data-end=&quot;2379&quot;&gt;Confident communicator with commercial fluency and presence when interacting with leadership and enterprise customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2382&quot; data-end=&quot;2476&quot;&gt;Customer-focused mindset with a passion for solving real-world data and reporting challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2479&quot; data-end=&quot;2580&quot;&gt;Deep product knowledge in analytics, data visualisation, and reporting (especially for SaaS or B2B)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2583&quot; data-end=&quot;2674&quot;&gt;Familiarity with AI/LLM-enabled product development and user-facing intelligence features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2677&quot; data-end=&quot;2773&quot;&gt;Experience working with large-scale data infrastructure (e.g., Clickhouse, columnar databases)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2776&quot; data-end=&quot;2862&quot;&gt;High data literacy and the ability to influence roadmap through evidence and insight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2865&quot; data-end=&quot;2928&quot;&gt;Experience managing complex, multi-threaded product work-streams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2930&quot; data-end=&quot;2949&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2930&quot; data-end=&quot;2947&quot;&gt;Extra awesome&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2952&quot; data-end=&quot;3033&quot;&gt;A strong track record building or buying advanced reporting and analytics tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3036&quot; data-end=&quot;3119&quot;&gt;Experience in survey tooling or working with flexible, unstructured response data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3122&quot; data-end=&quot;3189&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience delivering modern AI-powered product features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;*Typeform drives hundreds of millions of interactions each year, enabling conversational, human-centered experiences across the globe. We &lt;strong&gt;move as one team&lt;/strong&gt;, empowering our collective efforts by valuing each individual’s unique perspective. This fosters &lt;strong&gt;strong bonds&lt;/strong&gt; grounded in respect, transparency, and trust. We &lt;strong&gt;champion our diverse customer base&lt;/strong&gt; by anticipating their needs and addressing their challenges with priority. Committed to excellence, we&lt;strong&gt; hold high expectations &lt;/strong&gt;for ourselves and each other, continuously striving to deliver exceptional results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and stand firmly against discrimination and harassment of any kind—whether based on race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or expression, or veteran status. Everyone is welcome here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Who we are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typeform is a refreshingly different form builder. We help over 150,000 businesses collect the data they need with forms, surveys, and quizzes that people enjoy. Designed to look striking and feel effortless to fill out, Typeform drives 500 million responses every year—and integrates with essential tools like Slack, Zapier, and Hubspot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Product Manager to own and evolve Create &amp;amp; Design, the product where every Typeform begins.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every customer starts here. The builder is where ideas become forms, where brands come to life, and where our promise of beautifully designed, effortless experiences is either delivered or lost.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Typeform expands beyond forms into new surfaces and AI powered experiences, the builder needs to evolve too. The challenge is no longer just creating great forms. It is creating a platform that powers every future creation experience, while making world class design accessible to everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will own Create &amp;amp; Design end to end. You’ll define the strategy for our builder, evolve the shared platform beneath it, and work closely with Typeform AI to make creating great experiences faster, smarter, and more intuitive for every customer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work will define how millions of people create with Typeform, today and in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Create &amp;amp; Design team owns the core builder experience that powers every Typeform. From the editor and design system to version history, multilingual creation, brand kits, and custom domains, this is the surface where every customer creates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team sits within the Data Capture group and works closely with Blocks, Multi Format, Typeform AI, Response Data, Growth, and Design to build a creation experience that is simple on the surface, powerful underneath, and ready for the next generation of AI powered workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is one of the most important product surfaces at Typeform, and one that will define how creation evolves over the coming years.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Create &amp;amp; Design roadmap and product strategy, aligning it with the broader Data Capture vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve the builder into the best place to create beautiful, engaging experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platformise the shared capabilities that power creation across current and future surfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Typeform AI to bring AI assisted design, content generation, translation, and creation workflows into the builder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define how AI helps creators produce better work while maintaining a high quality, human experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex platform investments and technical migrations alongside customer facing product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with engineering and design to balance product craft with technical complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the long term vision for creation at Typeform and sequence investments against that strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor advances across AI, design tools, creator platforms, and modern productivity software to identify new opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross functionally with engineering, design, research, marketing, customer success, and commercial teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI tools to accelerate discovery, analysis, prototyping, documentation, and decision making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you already bring to the table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic product thinker with strong product instincts and high ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building creation tools, editors, design products, or other customer facing platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong platform thinking and experience identifying shared capabilities that scale across multiple products or surfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong appreciation for product craft and user experience, with the ability to balance speed and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI native mindset, you actively build with LLMs and AI tools, and see AI as a fundamental shift in how products are built and experienced&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with engineering on technically complex products, migrations, or platform investments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort discussing trade offs around performance, reliability, scalability, and technical architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer first mindset with strong discovery skills and data informed decision making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong storytelling and communication skills that help align teams around a clear vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative leadership style built on influence rather than authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High agency with the ability to create clarity in ambiguous problem spaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product craft, including writing specifications, defining success metrics, and driving execution across multiple teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working effectively across distributed teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A mindset of continuous learning, curiosity, and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
